  CaptionText: Supplier Contact - Arken
  BodyText: Blair is an isolationist mining colony that remained largely untouched
    by automation until recently. Frontier Robotics is rapidly expanding its presence
    in the colony's mines, prompting growing concerns. As strikes spread across the
    system, Blair has begun forging closer ties with other mining planets and stations.
